|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PARTSUPP.PS_SUPPKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.SUPPLIER.S_SUPPKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
